  - m_Id: 147046805491725
    m_Localized: Ocean world, cradle of the system's colonization. Scientific home
      of Nova Technology.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491726
    m_Localized: Rocky moon of Aster. A captured asteroid in its orbit hosts Apollo
      Outpost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491727
    m_Localized: Nova Technology's ring station. Labs, logistics and the main port
      of the Aster Sector.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491728
    m_Localized: Surface base on an asteroid orbiting Aster I. Ore extraction and
      refining.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491729
    m_Localized: Quiet asteroid field, good for beginner miners.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491730
    m_Localized: Arid golden world, rich in copper. A traditional cargo route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491731
    m_Localized: Small moon of Venera.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491732
    m_Localized: Magna Hauling Co.'s industrial platform. Containers, tanks and constant
      traffic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491733
    m_Localized: Copper and ice field. Pirates often prowl here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491734
    m_Localized: Gas giant with four moons. Administrative seat of the Federation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491735
    m_Localized: Inner moon of Centaurus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491736
    m_Localized: Moon of Centaurus that hosts the Federation yard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491737
    m_Localized: Moon of Centaurus ringed by a titanium field.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491738
    m_Localized: Distant icy moon of Centaurus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491739
    m_Localized: Federation yard. License control and official supply.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491740
    m_Localized: Field rich in titanium and cobalt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491741
    m_Localized: Giant asteroid at the heart of the Belt. It holds the central station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491742
    m_Localized: Atlas Universal's base in the most dangerous sector of the system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491743
    m_Localized: Dense, lucrative field. High pirate risk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491744
    m_Localized: Dense cobalt and ice field. High pirate risk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491745
    m_Localized: Jump gate to the Venera Sector.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147046805491746
    m_Localized: Jump gate to the Belt Sector.
    m_Metadata:
